%p
  Order #{link_to @order.id, admin_order_url(@order), :only_path => false} was paid, but the additional
  donation made with it could not be processed. The patron was told the box office will follow up.
%ul
  - @failures.each do |failure|
    %li= failure
- address = @order.address
- unless address.nil?
  %p
    = link_to address.full_name, admin_address_url(address)
    - if address.email.present?
      %br
      = mail_to address.email
    - if address.phone.present?
      %br
      Phone: #{address.phone}
